Hi all,

Thanks to:

Matt Thomas <thomas@lkg.dec.com>
Akihito 'ycos' Yakoshi <yakoshi@osa.dec.com>
<Craig.T.Biggerstaff@USAHQ.UnitedSpaceAlliance.com>

Who replied to the problem of the error in: 

/usr/sbin/screenmode on in /sbin/init.d/inet returns
ioctl (SIOCSCREENON): Operation not supported on socket.

AltaVista Firewall requires a number of pseudo-devices in the config.  The
one that was missing was:

pseudo-device gwscreen

It seems that performing a doconfig deletes this line.  Editing the
configuration file to re-insert it fixes the problem.


Thanks to all
Carlo Valpiani

