Hello.

I have a net with a mix of machines - Alphas running Digital Unix 4.0B, 
SGIs, Suns running SunOS 4.1.x, Suns running Solaris 2.5, and some older 
Encore real-time machines
running a somewhat old version of Encore's proprietary MPX OS.

