Thanks to all that responded... Toooooo many to list here...

To disklabel any drive that is not in the disktab file use

disklabel -rw rz# rzxx

The "rzxx" tells the command to go to the physical drive itself (rz0,
or whatever) to get the necessary information.  You would use it
instead of specifying a disk type (ie. RZ29B, RZ28, etc.).

